From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: rtl8189es: build rtw_get_wireless_stats only with CONFIG_WIRELESS_EXT

rtw_get_wireless_stats() is only referenced from rtw_handlers_def,
which is built under #ifdef CONFIG_WIRELESS_EXT. Without
CONFIG_WIRELESS_EXT (e.g. sunxi64 kernels, where only CFG80211_WEXT
is set) gcc warns that the static function is defined but not used.
Use the same guard for the function as for its only user.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/net/wireless/rtl8189es/os_dep/linux/ioctl_linux.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/rtl8189es/os_dep/linux/ioctl_linux.c b/drivers/net/wireless/rtl8189es/os_dep/linux/ioctl_linux.c
index 492e0f274..1fb306392 100644
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/rtl8189es/os_dep/linux/ioctl_linux.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/rtl8189es/os_dep/linux/ioctl_linux.c
@@ -12358,7 +12358,7 @@ static iw_handler rtw_private_handler[] = {
 	rtw_test,						/* 0x1D */
 };
 
-#if WIRELESS_EXT >= 17
+#if defined(CONFIG_WIRELESS_EXT) && WIRELESS_EXT >= 17
 static struct iw_statistics *rtw_get_wireless_stats(struct net_device *dev)
 {
 	_adapter *padapter = (_adapter *)rtw_netdev_priv(dev);
-- 
Armbian

